{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04228","headline":"秋晨同淄川毛司马秋九咏 秋水 · 骆宾王","name":"秋晨同淄川毛司马秋九咏 秋水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贝阙寒流彻，玉轮秋浪清。\n图云锦色净，写月练花明。\n泛曲鵾弦动，随轩凤辖惊。\n唯当御沟上，凄断送归情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04228.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04228","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}